who now, by the way, is a millionaire.

281
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:50,260
索恩教授∶接下来的节目是一个戏剧疑问,
Professor Thorn: Our next production poses a dramatic question,

282
00:17:50,560 --> 00:17:52,860
如果罗密欧和朱丽叶是滑稽戏会是什么样的呢?
what if Romeo and Juliet were mimes?

283
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:11,800
开萝尔∶如果林肯看到了这部戏,一定会想自杀的.
Carol: If Lincoln were here to see this play, he'd kill himself.

284
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:19,300
本∶真棒;真棒!
Ben: That was great, that was great!

285
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:20,860
开萝尔∶你为什么这样说?
Carol: How can you say that?

286
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:21,400
本∶我可以看见她的内衣.
Ben: Well I could see right down her dress.

287
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:27,900
戴维∶我们马上就要出场了,该死的迈克跑哪儿去了?
David: We're on next, where the heck is Mike?

288
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:29,960
凯特∶我不知道.
Kate: I don't know.

289
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:32,200
戴维∶哦!也许这些滑稽戏会被要求重演...我在和谁开玩笑?
David: Oh, maybe those mimes will get an encore...who am I kidding?

290
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:39,520
凯特∶迈克,你去哪里了?
Kate: Mike, where have you been?

291
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:41,560
迈克∶我在练台词.
Mike: I was running my lines.

292
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,500
凯特∶在哪里,我到处都找过了.
Kate: Where, I've been looking all over for you.

293
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,380
迈克∶凯特,我们可不可以只演戏?
Mike: Ah, look Kate, can we just stick to the play.

294
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:47,780
凯特∶迈克,你不能一直逃避我.
Kate: Mike, you can't keep avoiding me.

295
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:52,600
迈克∶我只是不想讨论我们现在不能讨论的事情,行吗?
Mike: It's just that I don't wanna talk about things that we can't talk about right now, OK?

296
00:18:52,600 --> 00:19:05,600
戴维:迈克!好吧,要记得,吻以为着一切.
David: Mike!OK guys, this is it, and remember, that kiss means everything.

297
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:08,000
杰森∶麦琪,你为什么一直和亚伦保持联系?
Jason: Maggie, why are you keeping in touch with this Aaron guy?

298
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:10,700
麦琪∶嘘.
Maggie: Sshh.

299
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:16,340
我们今天最后的一个节目,叫热情.
Professor Thorn: Our final one act of the evening is titled, The Passion,

300
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,200
凯特麦克旦尼尔和迈克尔西维尔主演.
starring Kate McDonnell and Michael Seaver.

301
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:22,900
麦琪∶喔,借光.
Maggie: Woo!Excuse me.

302
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:27,540
索恩教授∶导演戴维霍格,
Professor Thorn: And directed by David Hogue,

303
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,520
他和女主角很明显没有任何瓜葛.
who's apparently not related to this lady at all.

304
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:37,320
杰森∶我有问题要问你,麦琪.
Jason: I asked you a question, Maggie.

305
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:40,200
麦琪∶杰森,听着,
Maggie: Jason, listen, I wanna watch and see how Mike deals with having

306
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:40,760
我想要看看迈克会怎样处理在知道凯特喜欢他,
to kiss Kate,

307
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:42,000
而她男朋友却是编导的情况下,他和凯特的接吻.
knowing how Kate feels and that her boyfriend's the director.

308
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:48,900
杰森∶你偷听!那你根本就没有和那个家伙联系,对吗?
Jason: You eavesdropped!So you're not really keeping in touch with this guy at all, are you?

309
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:51,700
麦琪∶没有,如果你还不住嘴的话,我就会了.
Maggie: No.But I could if you don't dummy up.

310
00:19:51,700 --> 00:20:01,900
(戏剧)
(The Play)

311
00:20:03,380 --> 00:20:05,800
迈克∶是做出一个选择的时候了;你要继续留在城市里,为别人而活;还是要跟我一起离开?
Mike: OK, it's time to make a choice; you can stay here in this town

312
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:06,900
living other people's dreams or you can take a chance with me

313
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:12,900
凯特∶杰夫,我不能马上就决定我的一生.
Kate: Jeff, I can't decide my whole life in a moment.

314
00:20:15,180 --> 00:20:21,520
迈克∶我们现在只有一会的时间了.让我们吻别吧,杰西卡.(他们接吻)
Mike: Well a moment's all we got.Then kiss me goodbye, Jessica.(They kiss)

315
00:20:31,900 --> 00:20:37,500
杰森:哇.
Jason: Wow

316
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:41,440
本∶这才能叫家庭作业.
Ben: That's what I call homework.

317
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:53,800
凯特∶哦!迈克!
Kate: Oh Mike!

318
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:56,840
迈克∶哦!凯特,我再也不能隐藏我对你的感情了!我希望我可以,
Mike: Oh Kate, I can't hide my feelings for you any more!

319
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:59,540
但是,我真的不行.也许这样做是错的.
I wish I could, but I can't.Maybe this is wrong.

320
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,940
凯特∶不,不,没有错.
Kate: No, no, it's not wrong.

321
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:02,540
迈克∶我们向戴维去解释.
Mike: We'll explain this to David.

322
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,760
凯特∶是的,我们要告诉他,我们并不是有意要让它发生的.
Kate: Yeah, we'll just tell him that we didn't plan for it to happen.

323
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,440
迈克∶对,我们甚至都不希望它发生.
Mike: Yeah and that we didn't even want it to happen.

324
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:07,240
凯特∶他会理解我们的.
Kate: He'll understand.

325
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:08,520
迈克∶恩,是的,他是一个不错的家伙.
Mike: Oh yeah, he's a great guy.

326
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:08,620
凯特∶恩,是的,他是一个不错的家伙.
Kate: Oh, yeah, he's a great great guy.

327
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:13,420
戴维∶好你们2个!你们演的太好了!宝贝,
David: You guys!You guys were great!

328
00:21:14,060 --> 00:21:17,240
我知道最近几个礼拜我的表现差到了极点,但是,
Oh look honey, I know I've been a total jerk for the last few weeks,

329
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:20,700
我知道我们可以重新来过,凯蒂,我爱你.
but I know we can get things back the way they were, Katie.I love you.

330
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,300
索恩教授:好的,该谢幕了.
戴维∶我们走!
00:21:23,300
Professor Thorn: Alright people, it's time for the bows. David: Let's go!
